WEBVTT

00:00.520 --> 00:02.520
No one could threaten me before

00:02.800 --> 00:04.800
And never will in the future

00:08.920 --> 00:10.320
In this life

00:10.880 --> 00:13.547
Will only have one wife, the Xie family

00:15.000 --> 00:17.200
April of the 24th year of Xuan

00:17.480 --> 00:20.200
Sikong Yao purged the capital's gentry

00:20.600 --> 00:22.680
Chen Dao, finally arriving, was enraged

00:22.760 --> 00:24.840
Ordered Qingzhou Army to wear white headbands

00:24.920 --> 00:26.400
And fiercely attacked the capital

00:26.480 --> 00:29.480
Soon after, Zu Yue was also drawn into battle

00:29.560 --> 00:32.440
Xuan thus fell into prolonged civil war

00:34.500 --> 00:46.000
Prince Ning ascended the throne as Emperor and declared a general amnesty, yet had your lineage entirely struck from the imperial genealogy.

